{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1122074-infestation-vs-claws-swords","id":1122074,"title":"Infestation vs. Claws / Swords?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-28T15:04:13-07:00","id":1122074,"title":"Infestation vs. Claws / Swords?","content":"Infestation's Low Saity Effect redyces the severity of damage from &quot;firearms and piercing weapons.&quot; It later calls out that Infestation takes normal damage from ordinary fists and bludgeoning weapons.<br /> <br /> It doesn't mention slashing weapons at all, so what happens with them?<br /> <br /> When you spend Saitity to turn into a full swarm, does it affect how the Beast takes damage?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-28T15:12:01-07:00","id":1122082,"title":"","content":"I suppose blades do not cause any more damage than a baseball bat to a swarm, if even that, so I'd reduce them to bashing, too.<br /> <br /> There were rules somewhere on how to deal with a swarm. Don't remember where, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-28T15:39:30-07:00","id":1122095,"title":"","content":"There is no piercing/slashing/bludgeoning trilogy, like in D&amp;D. The intent of the power is that weapons that rely on bleeding and cutting have a reduced impact, because swarms don't care about that kind of thing. You crush bugs, you don't cut them. Swords and, yes, claws would have their damage reduced from lethal to bashing (though, agg claws still do agg damage). <br /> <br /> <br /> There's Lair traits and elemental Atavisms if you want to kill the swarm body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T07:21:40-07:00","id":1122331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1122074-infestation-vs-claws-swords?p=1122095#post1122095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is no piercing/slashing/bludgeoning trilogy, like in D&amp;D. The intent of the power is that weapons that rely on bleeding and cutting have a reduced impact, because swarms don't care about that kind of thing. You crush bugs, you don't cut them. Swords and, yes, claws would have their damage reduced from lethal to bashing (though, agg claws still do agg damage).<br /> <br /> <br /> There's Lair traits and elemental Atavisms if you want to kill the swarm body.</div> </div> </div> </div>KILL IT WITH (DRAGON)FIRE!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}